    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a suitcase positioned on the left side. To the right of the suitcase is a shirt, and these two items are aligned horizontally. Below the shirt is a pair of jeans, and directly below the jeans is a book. To the left of the book, there is a pair of glasses that is smaller than the book. Furthermore, for every cup located on the bottom side of the image, there is a bottle to its left, and each cup is positioned below the suitcase.",
